    "strict runs resolve only cmd[0] on the host: a program the child starts itself (sh -c cc, make recipes), a #! interpreter (#!/usr/bin/python3, #!/usr/bin/env node) and every link through /etc/alternatives resolve inside the sandbox, where /etc and programs outside the system directories are hidden, and exit 127 (cc, gcc, /usr/bin/python3 and node from sh -c; npm)"
